Output ./.github/assets/demo.gif
Require steep

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 2100
Set Height 1800

Type "steep"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Ctrl+H
Sleep 1s
Enter@800ms 1
Down@800ms 6
Enter@800ms 1

Sleep 2s

Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Type "w"
Sleep 1s
Type "afile{~/Cyber/wordlists/sectui/paths-api.txt}"
Sleep 1s
Escape

Type "s"
Sleep 8s

Ctrl+L
Sleep 1s

Down@800ms 6
Sleep 2s
